---
description: Windows is the only supported development OS
alwaysApply: true
---

All development happens on Windows. Canonical clone path: `C:\projects\shevon\`.

- Use PowerShell and Windows paths. Never assume bash, `/workspace`, or `/home/ubuntu`.
- Do not clone this repository onto Linux or keep a remote Linux environment. If one exists, delete it.
- Do not add Cursor Cloud Linux environment config (`.cursor/environment.json`, Dockerfiles, apt-based install scripts).
- Keep npm scripts Windows-safe. No `rm -rf` or other Unix-only shell.
- Electron/desktop builds target Windows (`npm run build:exe`).
